    {
      "id": "claim_42b2b3c1ac6e4a938efa7b2651c79b81",
      "statement": "The LangChain monorepo uses uv for dependency management, with each package in libs/ maintaining its own pyproject.toml and uv.lock file. Dependencies are installed via uv sync, with optional group selectors (--group test, --group lint, --all-groups) to control which tools and test dependencies are available.",
