      "statement": "All packages in libs/ expose consistent make targets: test/tests (run unit tests with pytest), lint (ruff check + format --diff + mypy), format (ruff format + ruff check --fix), type (mypy type checking), and help. Package-specific targets include integration_tests, test_watch, coverage, and extended_tests.",
