      "id": "claim_959d853bab90424c9967eb7be91e8a1e",
      "statement": "Ruff is the primary linting and formatting tool. make lint runs ruff check (linter), ruff format --diff (format checking), and mypy (type checking). make format applies ruff format and ruff check --fix to auto-fix issues. Ruff checks and formats Python files and Jupyter notebooks.",
