      "id": "claim_ea8ab007e4fe49ff83e7c06adbbbe76b",
      "statement": "PR titles must follow Conventional Commits 1.0.0 format with required scope: type(scope): description. Types include feat, fix, chore, docs, refactor, perf, test. Scopes are required and include core, langchain, partner names, infra, or docs. Description starts lowercase unless first word is proper noun or code entity.",
