      "id": "claim_ea6e1f914acb4615bc55d8b9f39b2d76",
      "statement": "Makefiles accept environment variables to customize test execution: UV_FROZEN=true prevents lock changes, TEST_FILE specifies test path (default tests/unit_tests/), PYTEST_EXTRA adds extra pytest flags, LANGGRAPH_TEST_FAST=1 uses in-memory services (fast mode) or =0 for Docker services (full mode).",
