      "id": "claim_aac1134248334f238d9eff8752b12b7a",
      "statement": "Key uv commands for development are: uv sync --all-groups (install all dependency groups), uv sync --group test (install test group only), uv run --group test pytest (run command in environment), uv lock (update lock file), uv run --with 'pkg>=1.0' (temporarily add dependency). uv manages virtual environments automatically without manual activation.",
